Module tower "A broken tower, and a chandler down the lane" {
  Place lane "the lane" is room.
  Place tower_site "the old tower" is site.
  Place foot "the foot of the tower" is room within tower_site at 0, 0 outdoors.
  Place top "the top of the tower" is room within tower_site at 0, 1 outdoors.
  Passage track "the track up from the lane" is path between lane and foot.
  Passage stair "the broken stair" is climb between foot and top needing climbing or rope.
  Company party "You" of 1 at foot.
  Person nest "Nest" at lane { Role "a chandler". Peaceable. Pronouns she. Sells rope for 2 coin from 3. }
  Initially Set quantity(party, gold) to 1.
  Observe foot_scene at foot when true "The tower's stair has fallen away below the door, all but its upper flight.".
  Goal false.
}
